Session readout:
  The Q=210 failure is not generic coarseness. It is an exact-period
  quotient loss: the two missed AP-drop mouths live in the repeated
  2-adic and 3-adic lanes. This gives a concrete proof target:
  preserve reduced-denominator packets until after the AP mouth /
  coimage wall ledger has been checked.
